# 🚀 Data Structures and Algorithms (DSA) in C++

Welcome to my DSA repository! This space is dedicated to building a strong foundation in problem-solving, mastering **C++ programming**, and implementing standard Data Structures and Algorithms.

---

## 📂 Repository Structure

Based on my local setup, the project is structured as follows:

```text
├── CPP Basics/           # Foundations and syntax fundamentals
│   ├── Arrays.cpp
│   ├── Conditionals.cpp
│   ├── DataType.cpp
│   ├── Patterns.cpp
│   └── Test.cpp
├── DSA/                  # Core Data Structures & Algorithms
│   ├── Patterns.cpp
│   └── STL.cpp           # Standard Template Library implementations
├── .gitignore
└── ReadME.md
```

---

## 🛠️ Environment & Setup

* **Language:** `C++ (C++17 or higher recommended)`
* **Compiler:** `g++` (GCC)
* **Editor:** VS Code

### Running the Code Locally

To compile and execute any script manually from the terminal, run the following commands:

```bash
# 1. Navigate to the desired folder
cd "CPP Basics"

# 2. Compile the file
g++ Arrays.cpp -o Arrays

# 3. Run the executable
./Arrays
```

